Description: DTK application development demonstration
 A code and text file viewer developed as a companion example for the
 dtk-development skill.
 .
 It provides tabs, asynchronous large-file loading, theme-aware DCI icons,
 window blur and DTK controls, together with single-instance handling,
 logging, translations, DConfig, desktop integration and Debian packaging.
